Legal texts

The texts of the Constitution and the codes of the Republic of Belarus in this repository are taken from ETALON-ONLINE
(https://etalonline.by/), the legal information system of the National Centre of Legislation and Legal Research of the
Republic of Belarus, from the editions it shows without registration. Official documents (normative legal acts) are not
objects of copyright under the Law of the Republic of Belarus No. 262-З of 17 May 2011 "On Copyright and Related
Rights", art. 8. Only that text is taken; the system's commentary, forms and other materials are not.

Changes made by Lexifina: each edition was split into one Markdown file per article, one paragraph per line; spacing,
quotes and dashes were normalised; headings, the table of contents, editorial notes and the signature were left out;
superscript numbers are written with a hyphen. The wording of the law was not changed. The publisher does not endorse
this repository.

Lexifina's work

Lexifina's own contributions (the arrangement of the history, the commit messages, the tables and the tools) are
dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0 Universal:
